{% comment %}
  Renders a structured allergen table for a product.

  Reads metafields:
  - product.metafields.shopify.allergen-information (Shopify standard category metafield)
      preferred source; type: list.metaobject_reference → Shopify taxonomy allergen values.
      Falls back to product.metafields.custom.allergens (a custom list.metaobject_reference)
      if the standard one is empty. The display name is read from `label` first, then `name`,
      then the system handle. The order shown follows the order set on the metafield in admin.
  - product.metafields.custom.allergen_contamination
      type: multi_line_text_field — コンタミネーション（混入の可能性）に関する注記（任意）

  The 「区分」(特定原材料 / 推奨表示) column is derived here from the fixed list of
  8 特定原材料 defined by Japan's 食品表示法 — no metaobject field is needed for it.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} required
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'component-allergen-table.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign allergens = product.metafields.shopify["allergen-information"].value | default: product.metafields.custom.allergens.value
  assign contamination = product.metafields.custom.allergen_contamination.value
  assign specified_raw_materials = '卵,乳,小麦,えび,かに,そば,落花生,くるみ' | split: ','
-%}

<div class="allergen-table">
  {%- if allergens == blank -%}
    <p class="allergen-table__empty">
      本商品のアレルゲン情報は現在準備中です。詳しくは<a href="/pages/contact">お問い合わせフォーム</a>よりお問い合わせください。
    </p>
  {%- else -%}
    <table class="allergen-table__table">
      <caption class="visually-hidden">本商品に含まれるアレルゲン一覧</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">アレルゲン</th>
          <th scope="col">区分</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {%- for a in allergens -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign a_name = a.label.value | default: a.label | default: a.name.value | default: a.name | default: a.system.handle
            if specified_raw_materials contains a_name
              assign a_category = '特定原材料'
            else
              assign a_category = '推奨表示'
            endif
          -%}
          <tr>
            <th scope="row" class="allergen-table__name">
              {%- if a.icon.value != blank -%}
                {{
                  a.icon.value
                  | image_url: width: 48
                  | image_tag: alt: '', loading: 'lazy', widths: '24, 48', class: 'allergen-table__icon'
                }}
              {%- endif -%}
              <span>{{ a_name | escape }}</span>
            </th>
            <td class="allergen-table__category">{{ a_category }}</td>
          </tr>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if contamination != blank -%}
    <p class="allergen-table__contamination">{{ contamination | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}

  <p class="allergen-table__note">
    アレルギーをお持ちの方は、念のためご注文前に<a href="/pages/contact">お問い合わせフォーム</a>よりご相談ください。
    原材料は仕入れ状況により変更となる場合があります。
  </p>
</div>
